  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Free and Pro limits",
      "items": [
        "Free account: 5 install unlocks and 30 MCP calls a day, counted per Vietnam day",
        "MCP with no key: 10 calls and 2 installs a day per salted IP hash; on the web, visitors sign in to unlock",
        "Pro (profiles.fulltime) has no limit and gets the one-prompt kit install",
        "If quota_use errors, quota() allows the call instead of blocking everyone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Pro through Polar",
      "items": [
        "Checkout is created server-side with external_customer_id = the Airsc user id",
        "customer.state_changed: the webhook re-reads granted benefits from Polar, then calls set_pro",
        "order.paid / order.refunded land in public.orders; /admin can sync all orders from Polar",
        "Admins can give or take Pro by hand through the same set_pro RPC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Content Engine and X",
      "items": [
        "Cron fires hourly at :00 (the engine, once per Vietnam day at the hour set in /admin) and :30 (drafts, numbers, review), and every five minutes to send posts that are due",
        "The engine drafts a spotlight for each posting hour; applied posts are written from your notes; all wait in /admin/social/queue",
        "A post that tags its author goes out as written only after approval; an unapproved spotlight goes out without the @",
        "Every three days Sonnet reviews the numbers read from X and rewrites the writing guidance",
        "AI work stops when the gateway balance or run cap is hit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not drawn / code vs README",
      "items": [
        "Ko-fi webhook still records gifts; /support now redirects to /pricing",
        "README says the engine runs at 02:00 UTC; the hour is a setting in /admin",
        "/api/cron/crawl exists but vercel.ts does not schedule it"
      ]
    }
  ]
}